자비수 offers Sketchy (https://github.com/ddkbs/sketchy, MIT License) as a drawing tool that is downloaded the first
time it is used. It runs a version adapted by 명상(明想) at https://github.com/SeokMyungSeop/sketchy, which draws
Hangul, keeps Korean titles in file names and saves drawings into the 작업실. The downloaded folder carries this
license, the licenses of its fonts (Kalam and Nanum Pen Script, both SIL Open Font License 1.1) and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for everything else it builds on.

